given-names-ssa.ts is generated by tools/build_given_names.py from the US Social Security
Administration's national baby-name data (https://www.ssa.gov/oact/babynames/limits.html,
names.zip). The data is a work of the US Government and in the public domain. Kept: names given
to at least 300 US babies since 1930, lower-cased, 3+ letters, minus the hand-curated lists.
Rebuild: python -I tools/build_given_names.py PATH/TO/names.zip
